        {"zh": "嗯，这是最好的食物！", "en": "Mmm, that’s the best food."},
        {"zh": "吃这个，保证你强壮！", "en": "Eat this, makes you strong."},
        {"zh": "你不想试试这东西吗？", "en": "You wanna try this?"},
        {"zh": "吃了我给的，你不会后悔！", "en": "Eat what I give, you won’t regret it."},
        {"zh": "来吧，吃点胡萝卜！", "en": "Come on, have a carrot."},
        {"zh": "吃掉它们，强壮起来！", "en": "Eat them, get strong."},
        {"zh": "别抵抗，吃点吧！", "en": "Don’t resist, eat this!"}
